{"3655430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Waking Ashes", "steam_appid": 3655430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655430/extras/48279f186f1f3e6c451828e7aa23dd88.poster.avif?t=1787248047\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655430/extras/48279f186f1f3e6c451828e7aa23dd88.webm?t=1787248047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655430/extras/48279f186f1f3e6c451828e7aa23dd88.mp4?t=1787248047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Waking Ashes throws you into zero-G combat across a world shattered by its own designer, Temple, an ancient mind constructed by a long lost community of cosmic beings. You are but one of its unwilling creations, dragged back from the depths out of an obsessive mystical necessity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claw your way through ruined landscapes and twisted creatures, chasing scraps of freedom in a place where stone, magic and spirit have fused into unholy drones of Temple's will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own fighting style from an upgradable arsenal of deadly weapons, strange powers and abilities. Blink through space, slow the flow of time, or unleash devastating tactical strikes. When the physical world grows too predictable, breach the boundary into the Deep Array, a warped pocket dimension where Temple’s true form resides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zero-gravity six-degree-of-freedom flight combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable, upgradable loadouts across primary, secondary, ability slots, and character attributes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast open world with progression and hidden secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade consoles, lore logs, and ancient mini-bosses to uncover a haunting narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transition into the Deep Array to overcome impossible odds defeating waves of enemies</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655430/extras/48279f186f1f3e6c451828e7aa23dd88.poster.avif?t=1787248047\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655430/extras/48279f186f1f3e6c451828e7aa23dd88.webm?t=1787248047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655430/extras/48279f186f1f3e6c451828e7aa23dd88.mp4?t=1787248047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Waking Ashes throws you into zero-G combat across a world shattered by its own designer, Temple, an ancient mind constructed by a long lost community of cosmic beings. You are but one of its unwilling creations, dragged back from the depths out of an obsessive mystical necessity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claw your way through ruined landscapes and twisted creatures, chasing scraps of freedom in a place where stone, magic and spirit have fused into unholy drones of Temple's will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own fighting style from an upgradable arsenal of deadly weapons, strange powers and abilities. Blink through space, slow the flow of time, or unleash devastating tactical strikes. When the physical world grows too predictable, breach the boundary into the Deep Array, a warped pocket dimension where Temple’s true form resides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zero-gravity six-degree-of-freedom flight combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable, upgradable loadouts across primary, secondary, ability slots, and character attributes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast open world with progression and hidden secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade consoles, lore logs, and ancient mini-bosses to uncover a haunting narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transition into the Deep Array to overcome impossible odds defeating waves of enemies</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A momentum driven sci-fi action shooter. Dash, teleport, slow time and fly in six degrees of freedom to survive relentless combat. Customize and upgrade your weapon and ability load-out to push through escalating enemy encounters in a strange zero gravity open world.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655430/ada4e7b50b20a79744a2c9cf1e9fb6955233a5ce/header.jpg?t=1787248047", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655430/6c8018e487142d141b5b08209ce21d3938e1f417/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787248047", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655430/6c8018e487142d141b5b08209ce21d3938e1f417/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787248047", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (32 or 64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 480 or AMD Radeon HD 5870 (1 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><l